<p>We're here to help. If something isn't working or you have a question, reach out: we reply fast, on the same WhatsApp you already use.</p>

<div class="box">
  <p><strong>Message us on WhatsApp</strong> (fastest): <a href={wa}>open a chat with Zymplo</a>.</p>
  <p><strong>Or by email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@zymplo.com">support@zymplo.com</a> · we reply within 24 business hours.</p>
</div>

<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

<h3>How do I get started with Zymplo?</h3>
<p>Zymplo lives inside your WhatsApp — there's nothing awkward to install. Send the bot a message and follow the steps: you'll be up and running in a minute. If you downloaded the app, you sign in with the same WhatsApp number.</p>

<h3>How do I connect my WhatsApp?</h3>
<p>When you sign up, a confirmation message arrives on WhatsApp. You confirm with a button and that's it: from there Zymplo helps you organize your clients and your payments. If the message never arrived, double-check the number is correct and get in touch.</p>

<h3>How do I charge a client?</h3>
<p>You tell Zymplo who to charge and how much, and it builds the payment message with the payment link ready to send. It also reminds you when a client hasn't paid yet, so no one slips through.</p>

<h3>How do I issue an invoice?</h3>
<p>In Brazil, you ask Zymplo on WhatsApp to issue the invoice (NFS-e) for a payment and it generates it for you. If any tax detail is missing, Zymplo tells you exactly which one so the invoice comes out right.</p>

<h3>How do I delete my account?</h3>
<p>You can delete your account and all your data whenever you want. It's all explained, step by step, in <a href="/legal/delete-account/">Delete my account</a>.</p>

<h3>Can I talk to a person?</h3>
<p>Yes. Write to <a href="mailto:support@zymplo.com">support@zymplo.com</a> or message us on <a href={wa}>WhatsApp</a> and someone on the team will help you — not a robot.</p>

